      "locked": false,
      "text": "So here we have Student.java class\nwhich is dependent on Laptop class\nwhich we are managing and creating\nusing new() keyword but,now we want \nspring to manage-so there are 3 way \nspring can inject dependency: ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "So here we have Student.java class\nwhich is dependent on Laptop class\nwhich we are managing and creating\nusing new() keyword but,now we want \nspring to manage-so there are 3 way \nspring can inject dependency: ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "gVw7e-scyuNEK51RhyLcl",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 930.0979298084163,
      "y": 18612.00799826599,
      "width": 385,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
