      "text": "okay till now we have seen Di,ioc and bean \nbut these things are mostly done by spring boot\nso in order to understand spring boot we need\nto understand spring \n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "okay till now we have seen Di,ioc and bean \nbut these things are mostly done by spring boot\nso in order to understand spring boot we need\nto understand spring \n",
      "autoResize": true,
