      "updated": 1763878784435,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Now let's dive deep into Constructor injection",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Now let's dive deep into Constructor injection",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Xuiubc08CJunnkB1CY_1B",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 584.7588906740494,
      "y": 48832.98220497596,
      "width": 723.7996826171875,
      "height": 350,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bSy",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1811388483,
      "version": 48,
      "versionNonce": 1350532365,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1763878801037,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Constructor Injection in Spring Core (XML\nConfiguration)\n\nConstructor Injection is the mechanism where\nSpring calls your class constructor and passes\nthe required dependency using the <constructor-\narg> tag in XML.\n\nThis is how Spring Core used DI before\nannotations existed.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Constructor Injection in Spring Core (XML Configuration)\n\nConstructor Injection is the mechanism where Spring calls your class constructor and passes the required dependency using the <constructor-arg> tag in XML.\n\nThis is how Spring Core used DI before annotations existed.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ESvgUL-M69lm32OXcEzVK",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 561.7987280654485,
      "y": 49186.13717385414,
      "width": 812.5517435177683,
      "height": 910,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bSz",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1302589827,
      "version": 137,
      "versionNonce": 1162334765,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1763878844511,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Example Classes\n\n\nLaptop.java\n\npublic class Laptop {\n    public void compile() {\n        System.out.println(\"Laptop Compiling...\");\n    }\n}\n\nStudent.java\n\npublic class Student {\n\n    private Laptop laptop;\n\n    // Constructor Injection\n    public Student(Laptop laptop) {\n        this.laptop = laptop;\n    }\n\n    public void code() {\n        laptop.compile();\n    }\n}",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Example Classes\n\n\nLaptop.java\n\npublic class Laptop {\n    public void compile() {\n        System.out.println(\"Laptop Compiling...\");\n    }\n}\n\nStudent.java\n\npublic class Student {\n\n    private Laptop laptop;\n\n    // Constructor Injection\n    public Student(Laptop laptop) {\n        this.laptop = laptop;\n    }\n\n    public void code() {\n        laptop.compile();\n    }\n}",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
