      "link": null,
      "locked": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gZ2mnxuXWFCFtEXqESnLe",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 593.5814888497445,
      "y": 50873.99447208772,
      "width": 677.5997924804688,
      "height": 315,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bT8",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1256178829,
      "version": 50,
      "versionNonce": 151557219,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1763878945049,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "What happens here?\n\nSpring creates a Laptop object\n\nThen Spring creates Student(laptopObject) by\npassing the Laptop to the constructor\n\nThis is true DI, because Student does not\ncreate Laptop.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "What happens here?\n\nSpring creates a Laptop object\n\nThen Spring creates Student(laptopObject) by passing the Laptop to the constructor\n\nThis is true DI, because Student does not create Laptop.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Pe8Z-rNP_99ib4-JOBtx1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 568.768389032025,
      "y": 51229.84149890497,
      "width": 1176.102425920478,
      "height": 700,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bT9",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 912665411,
      "version": 181,
      "versionNonce": 679782765,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1763879081239,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "3. Main Method (Spring Core — No Spring Boot)\n\nimport org.springframework.context.ApplicationContext;\nimport org.springframework.context.support.ClassPathXmlApplicationContext;\n\npublic class Main {\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n\n        ApplicationContext context =\n                new ClassPathXmlApplicationContext(\"spring.xml\");\n\n        Student student = (Student) context.getBean(\"studentBean\");\n        student.code();\n    }\n}\n\n\nOutput:\n\nLaptop Compiling...",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "3. Main Method (Spring Core — No Spring Boot)\n\nimport org.springframework.context.ApplicationContext;\nimport org.springframework.context.support.ClassPathXmlApplicationContext;\n\npublic class Main {\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n\n        ApplicationContext context =\n                new ClassPathXmlApplicationContext(\"spring.xml\");\n\n        Student student = (Student) context.getBean(\"studentBean\");\n        student.code();\n    }\n}\n\n\nOutput:\n\nLaptop Compiling...",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "l5rhXPnWeE8jNa0LbaPTQ",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 557.1757141676864,
      "y": 51286.34310725723,
      "width": 1164.4512145381345,
