    {
      "id": "e4M2ADRAcSIPQAG2_KRmF",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 682.1127316752882,
      "y": 69438.71668820443,
      "width": 726,
      "height": 325,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bV1",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1316365571,
      "version": 102,
      "versionNonce": 1611352589,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1763882885256,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2. Autowiring byType\n\nSpring injects dependency by matching the class type.\n\nspring.xml\n<bean id=\"laptop1\" class=\"org.example.Laptop\"/>\n\n<bean id=\"student\" class=\"org.example.Student\" autowire=\"byType\"/>\n\n\n✔ Only one Laptop bean exists → Injected\n❌ If two Laptop beans exist → Error\n(Spring becomes confused which one to inject)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2. Autowiring byType\n\nSpring injects dependency by matching the class type.\n\nspring.xml\n<bean id=\"laptop1\" class=\"org.example.Laptop\"/>\n\n<bean id=\"student\" class=\"org.example.Student\" autowire=\"byType\"/>\n\n\n✔ Only one Laptop bean exists → Injected\n❌ If two Laptop beans exist → Error\n(Spring becomes confused which one to inject)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "cN0x0OMJqCg-3dqzXtYmu",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 680.7966426029654,
